# Loaded by `vite --mode benchmark` (npm run benchmark). The benchmark-record
# rig: diagnostics capture is ON (per-transfer reports saved version-stamped
# to scratch/diagnostics-runs/), and the sender is locked to the canonical
# 1 MB benchmark payload (public/benchmark.png) so every record measures the
# exact same bytes — the promotion gate verifies the pinned sha-256. See
# docs/technical/diagnostics.md. Dev server only; nothing here ships (the
# client code sits behind import.meta.env.DEV).
VITE_DIAGNOSTICS=1
VITE_BENCHMARK=1
